         "type": "part",
         "label": "a",
         "prompt": "Which of $4,\\ 9,\\ 25,\\ 100$ and $225$ are factors of $450$?",
         "answerSpaceMm": 20,
         "answer": {
          "short": "$9,\\ 25$ and $225$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}450\\div4&=112.5\\\\450\\div9&=50\\\\450\\div25&=18\\\\450\\div100&=4.5\\\\450\\div225&=2\\end{align*}$$\n$9,\\ 25$ and $225$ are factors of $450$."
